<title>FINLAND: Nokia CEO sees enhanced competitiveness.</title>
<headline>Nokia CEO sees enhanced competitiveness.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jorma Ollila, CEO of Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy, said on Tuesday that new products would revitalise competitiveness and that the group had a solid foundation for future success.</p>
<p>&quot;In the early part of 1997, we launched or introduced a host of new products that will revitalise our competitiveness during the year,&quot; Ollila said in a summary of his speech to Nokia's annual general meeting on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
